INSERT INTO `cy_article` VALUES ('10', '3', '1', '0', 'admin', 'fasdfasdfasdf', '', 'fasdfsafasdf', 'sadfasdfasdfaasffsddsfa', '<p class=\"hongse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 15px 15px 15px 35px; outline: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(235, 177, 177); vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgb(204, 102, 102); background: url(&quot;images/wpgo_sc_error.png&quot;) -1px -1px no-repeat rgb(255, 236, 234); overflow: hidden; font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; text-indent: 1em !important;\">去年10月份公司组织出去游玩，去了一趟本溪的关门山，其实我的骨子里还是喜欢旅行的尤其是看这一路上的风景，远比你到达目的地要幸福的多，（咳咳，跑题啦）。早上凌晨五点多集合（沈阳出发）到达关门山的时候正好八九点钟，按道理来说我是应该带着相机去了，可是，我太懒了，不愿意拿，就把手机充满电出发了。</p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">到了关门山之后，我就后悔啦，这初秋的景色简直就是让人心旷神怡啊，于是走一路，拍一路，今天没事整理了一下，找了几张拿得出手的照片，纪念一下：</p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">1.这是下午返回时，在桥上拍摄的。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><a class=\"view-image\" href=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644418766868.jpg\" title=\"P61018-130044(1).jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 3px; padding: 0px; background: transparent; color: rgb(252, 84, 73); vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, Arial, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0); transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><img class=\"ue-image\" src=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644418766868.jpg\" title=\"P61018-130044(1).jpg\" alt=\"P61018-130044(1).jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto; transition: all 0.3s ease-out 0s;\"/></a></p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">2.这是在什么峡谷拍摄的，水流很清，看得见河底的沙砾<br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><a class=\"view-image\" href=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644431291615.jpg\" title=\"P61018-121656.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 3px; padding: 0px; background: transparent; color: rgb(252, 84, 73); vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, Arial, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0); transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><img class=\"ue-image\" src=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644431291615.jpg\" title=\"P61018-121656.jpg\" alt=\"P61018-121656.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto; transition: all 0.3s ease-out 0s;\"/></a></p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">3.拍摄的时候在水面上，手机差点没掉下去。。。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><a class=\"view-image\" href=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644449616506.jpg\" title=\"P61018-114609.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 3px; padding: 0px; background: transparent; color: rgb(252, 84, 73); vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, Arial, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0); transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><img class=\"ue-image\" src=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644449616506.jpg\" title=\"P61018-114609.jpg\" alt=\"P61018-114609.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto; transition: all 0.3s ease-out 0s;\"/></a></p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">4.水至清则无鱼。<br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><a class=\"view-image\" href=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644464175123.jpg\" title=\"P61018-121649.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 3px; padding: 0px; background: transparent; color: rgb(252, 84, 73); vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, Arial, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0); transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><img class=\"ue-image\" src=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644464175123.jpg\" title=\"P61018-121649.jpg\" alt=\"P61018-121649.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto; transition: all 0.3s ease-out 0s;\"/></a></p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">5.爬上的时候拍摄的！<br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><a class=\"view-image\" href=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644477612927.jpg\" title=\"P61018-113522.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 3px; padding: 0px; background: transparent; color: rgb(252, 84, 73); vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, Arial, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0); transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><img class=\"ue-image\" src=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644477612927.jpg\" title=\"P61018-113522.jpg\" alt=\"P61018-113522.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto; transition: all 0.3s ease-out 0s;\"/></a></p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">6.压轴的来了，这张照片是我最喜欢的，“会当凌绝顶，一览众山小”，另外参加魅族“一叶知秋”摄影活动，获得优秀奖！<br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><a class=\"view-image\" href=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644490323072.jpg\" title=\"P61018-111302.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 3px; padding: 0px; background: transparent; color: rgb(252, 84, 73); vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, Arial, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0); transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><img class=\"ue-image\" src=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644490323072.jpg\" title=\"P61018-111302.jpg\" alt=\"P61018-111302.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto; transition: all 0.3s ease-out 0s;\"/></a></p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\">7.飞流直下三千尺，哈哈，没有那么高啊，也就两三米吧。<br/></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><a class=\"view-image\" href=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644499881208.jpg\" title=\"P61018-085022.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 3px; padding: 0px; background: transparent; color: rgb(252, 84, 73); vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, Arial, Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0); transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><img class=\"ue-image\" src=\"http://quietlee.001666.cn/zb_users/upload/2017/08/201708251503644499881208.jpg\" title=\"P61018-085022.jpg\" alt=\"P61018-085022.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; height: auto; transition: all 0.3s ease-out 0s;\"/></a></p><p class=\"putong\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; outline: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 3px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(227, 227, 227) rgb(61, 171, 206); border-image: initial; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 15px; line-height: 27px; position: relative; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.88); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; text-indent: 1em !important;\">图片有点大1080像素，服务器低配，加载可能缓慢一点。。。</p><p><br/></p>', 'uploads/img/202309/ad2cd604522528931cbc4102695c1bd9.jpg', 'uploads/thumb/202309/84e890f2a021ba28d74e2008940b4baf.jpg', '', '13', '0', '0', '1', '1', '0', '100', '', '1695470514', '1695621369');
